{
  "bookId": "hero-213110",
  "id": "bond-28574",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28574001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "这是什么……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28574002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "光坂高中三年E班的教室，怎么会出现在这里？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28574004",
              "text": "是送给你的礼物哦。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28574003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28574004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "给我的……吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28574005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "确实是有很多回忆的地方……这间教室承载着许多人的青春呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28574006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "说吧，你想从我这里得到什么好处？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28574008",
              "text": "完全没有这回事。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28574007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28574008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "好吧，我给你时间慢慢考虑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28574009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "等什么时候想到了，我会帮你实现的……大概吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28574010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "教室里我的位子上，堆满了的字典也是给我的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28574012",
              "text": "不然呢？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28574011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28574012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "挺能干的嘛……你还真是做了不少功课。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28574013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "我是个笨蛋，你对我这么温柔的话，我……我会误会的哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
